				"critical": "Freezing kills parasites; do not skip it for wild or uncertain fish."
			},
			{
				"id": "s2",
				"text": "Mix sugar, salt and pepper. Cut the fillet in two, rub the mixture into the flesh and sandwich with dill, flesh to flesh.",
